OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland owner in crunch talks as
OL,4,Aretailer's collapse looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness Secretary Jonathan Reynolds
OL,7,Fhas met the US-based owners of
OL,8,FPoundland as the government hopes to
OL,9,Fsave the retailer from collapse.
OL,11,FThe discount chain is on the brink of
OL,12,Finsolvency and Gordon Brothers, which
OL,13,Fbought it for #1 last June, has
OL,14,Frejected a takeover bid which could
OL,15,Fhave saved the 12,000 jobs currently at
OL,16,Frisk.
OL,18,FA meeting was due to be held on
OL,19,FThursday but has been brought forward
OL,20,Fas the scramble to secure a rescue deal
OL,21,Ffor the firm intensifies.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
